<title>CANADA: Alcan Aluminium Q4 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Alcan Aluminium Q4 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr			US$0.31		  US$0.17</p>
<p> Net			 72,000		   46,000</p>
<p> Revs		   1,800,000		2,185,000</p>
<p>	   12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			US$1.74		  US$1.06</p>
<p> Net			410,000		  263,000</p>
<p> Revs		   7,614,000		9,287,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 226,500		  225,800</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers) Note: Full company name is Alcan Aluminium Ltd. Year earlier net income includes extraordinary after-tax loss of US$280 million, or US$1.24, a share relating to the September writedown of the company's investment in the Kemano Completion Project.</p>
<p>((Reuters Montreal bureau 514-985-2434))</p>
